notes.content:
I am glad to inform you that the final level has been completed, as well as the finishing touches. Infernales is over, and now you can complete it completely, from start to finish !. Soon will be a full release of the game, as well as the release of soundtracks. The last few days to buy "Infernales" at a low price!
You can still leave your thoughts about the game in the subject of the message, and also report the bugs you found.

List of changes:
Added a new level;
The new monster is the Devil;
New music;
Added prologue and epilogue

